{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14108072","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108072","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410807101:":{"text":"이쪽이야!","source_cn":"这边！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E17425FF421273","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이쪽이야!","female":"이쪽이야!","variant_male_record_index":"160212","variant_female_record_index":"160213","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410807102:":{"text":"둘 다 나오도록.","source_cn":"两位，出来吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0FE1698D4B330855","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"둘 다 나오도록.","female":"둘 다 나오도록.","variant_male_record_index":"160214","variant_female_record_index":"160215","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410807201:1":{"text":"요즘 경비대의 분위기가 어수선합니다. 제발 부하들을 좀 단속해 주십시오!","source_cn":"沙利叶，现在卫队一团乱，你能不能好好约束自己的队伍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADCE691B5E4B53BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410807202:1":{"text":"오, 그래요? 하지만 따지고 보면 모두 당신들의 잘못이지요...","source_cn":"哦，那又如何？说来也都是你们的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC5BD77677A9F841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410807203:1":{"text":"저희 잘못이라니요?","source_cn":"我们的错？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27E73361593E432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410807204:1":{"text":"인듀어를 가둔 당신들 탓 아닙니까? 인듀어가 없으니 이렇게 된 것이지요.","source_cn":"谁让你们把因度厄关了起来，他不管，卫队可不就瘫痪了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D2F0E0ABA802CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410807205:1":{"text":"근위대의 통솔자는 당신입니다!","source_cn":"你才是卫队的统领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802BB5307F8F6161","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410807206:1":{"text":"굳이 제가 나설 필요 있겠습니까? 각자 책임이 있다는 것을 알고 계시다면 근위대 일에 참견하지 않는 게 좋을 것 같군요.","source_cn":"管理者不需要自己过问，手下才是真正干活的人。你既然知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F3C51072F09C28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410807207:1":{"text":"경비가 느슨해지면 분노에 찬 평민들이 무슨 짓을 할 지 모르겠군요. 질서를 위해서라도 인듀어를 하루 빨리 풀어주는 게 어떻겠습니까?","source_cn":"我可不知道一旦缺乏管教，那些易怒的平民又会做出什么事来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81EE6B83A43CC3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410807208:1":{"text":"그럴 순 없습니다. 인듀어는 너무 많은 것을 알아버렸고, 여왕님의 뜻을 저버리지 않았습니까.","source_cn":"不可能，他已经知道了太多，又违逆了女王陛下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51C350167DBFF92C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410807209:1":{"text":"그래요, 당연하죠. 인듀어가 당신처럼 제 어머니의 충견이 될 리 없으니.","source_cn":"是是是，他当然不能跟你一样，最后沦为我母亲的狗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17A9D5F5B4BF5FD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410807210:1":{"text":"당신...!","source_cn":"你——<key:dialog42>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0E9D151EDEA0BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410807211:0":{"text":"아, 퀸이 당신을 등나무 회견실에서 기다리고 있겠다고 하더군요.","source_cn":"哦，对了，奎茵说有事找你，紫藤会见厅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F2521EBE86BBC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410807212:1":{"text":"예, 잘 알겠습니다!","source_cn":"我知道了，你好自为之！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D1E05C83D322F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:19:1410807101:":{"text":"이쪽이야!","source_cn":"这边！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E17425FF421273","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이쪽이야!","female":"이쪽이야!","variant_male_record_index":"160212","variant_female_record_index":"160213","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_